# ─── Environment / secrets ───────────────────────────────────
# Vite bundles every VITE_*-prefixed value into the client JS
# on build, so anything sensitive must never live here. Kept
# gitignored regardless of contents so per-environment overrides
# don't leak.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
